Backport of NixOS/nix#16477 (Mic92, open since 2026-09-16) to 2.35.3: its
source change, plus the DeleteRealisedOutputByName statement it uses, which
upstream added after 2.35.3 (with `nix store build-trace delete`). Its
functional tests target files 2.35 does not have.
https://github.com/NixOS/nix/pull/16477

diff --git a/src/libstore/local-store.cc b/src/libstore/local-store.cc
index e1cf8dd7d..d08f661f7 100644
